  "title": "Tumble dryer 600x600x850",
  "description": "White front-loading tumble dryer, 600 wide x 600 deep x 850 high. Its origin is the back-left-bottom corner and the front faces -Y. It has a round door with a dark glass window, a control panel with a dial, and a lint/condenser drawer at the bottom.",
